</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coffee World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an extensive <strong>tree of coffee recipes,</strong> each with its own unique combination of ingredients and brewing techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and maintain various <strong>coffee-making appliances,</strong> from espresso machines to pour-over setups, to unlock new brewing methods and enhance flavor profiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of efficient brewing, <strong>balancing speed and quality</strong> to serve a growing line of customers and maximize your profits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tea World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>rich world of tea recipes</strong>, where every type of tea requires a unique blend of leaves, ingredients, and brewing methods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of preparing traditional matcha, discover the subtleties of steeping black tea, or learn to create delicious bubble tea in a variety of flavors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tea-making equipment, from matcha preparation tools to modern bubble tea machines, and <strong>enhance your tea craft</strong> one step at a time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ice Cream World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the diverse <strong>world of ice cream recipes</strong>. Master the craft of creating classic scoopable ice cream with a smooth, creamy texture, blending refreshing milkshakes, or making fruity popsicles and sorbets that cool you off on the hottest days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake crispy cookies for ice cream sandwiches and experiment with unique flavors that will delight every sweet tooth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect your mixing and freezing techniques</strong> to achieve the ideal consistency and taste that will satisfy all foodies. Continuously upgrade your equipment, from ice cream machines to baking tools, and offer new, innovative experiences like the Italian affogato, combining ice cream with espresso.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649080/extras/3c94ecd630ccc8bdce86ac3bcbefd506.poster.avif?t=1755083705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649080/extras/3c94ecd630ccc8bdce86ac3bcbefd506.webm?t=1755083705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649080/extras/3c94ecd630ccc8bdce86ac3bcbefd506.mp4?t=1755083705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a <strong>unique road trip experience</strong>, ensuring that no two journeys are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose customers at <strong>different levels of difficulty</strong>, from easy levels for learning the basics to challenging hard levels that cater to more sophisticated tastes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find scattered <strong>appliance and recipe shops</strong> along the way to purchase and upgrade your equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>special events and challenges</strong> along the way, from rewards to unexpected circumstances, to add excitement to your road trip adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The final boss</strong> customers are the epitome of taste perfectionism, setting the highest standard for your coffee-making skills in the grand finale of the journey.</p></li></ul>",
